// The sidebar's parts (N-412 ask 2, N-473): which part each agent is in, "/" nesting a part under another. An agent
// with no part stands above them (paper-research) or, leading nobody, in Pool. coordd reads these lines as written
// (coordd policy/parts.rs): an agent's first `part` line counts, a part's first `part-place` line. The way back is
// removing this file.
// Since 18 Nov 13:55 the parts under "yaaihh project" are cut by what a team owns from engine to window, not by
// layer (owner, N-481 p17: "a few more teams of 2-3 specialts"); the two who merge and release stand apart.
Fact part Identified by agent * String
Fact part-place Identified by String * Int

+part("docket-core", "yaaihh project/Merge and release").
+part("docket-edge", "yaaihh project/Merge and release").
+part("docket-core3", "yaaihh project/Merge and release").
